WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.167
Give the project a name and a unique key.

2
00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:09.017
Describe what the team will test.

3
00:00:09.017 --> 00:00:15.983
Place the project in a portfolio and save it.

4
00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:21.483
The portfolio brings related products together.

5
00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:28.200
Each product keeps its own project.

6
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
Open Mobile Banking to see its testing scope.

7
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:38.650
Go straight to its test repository.

8
00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:42.167
Expand a folder to browse the checks.

9
00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:48.333
Open a case with its scenario and expected result.
